  "notes": "Egress 'only within the VPC CIDR' is checked twice: egress_vpc_cidr requires an egress rule that targets the VPC CIDR (reference or equal value); egress_only_vpc requires every egress CIDR of the chosen rule form to be a non-/0 range or an expression (IPv6 ::/0 not checked). Inbound SSH is not required to be VPC-scoped: the 'only within' clause is read as applying to outbound."
